@startuml http_session_creation
title CampusClaw HTTP Session Creation

' Source evidence (pi-mono-java PR 167 f60cc3e78bb8b700527ac082c7c8e10524ede095):
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/session/RuntimeSessionService.java, create.
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/agent/FileAgentDirectoryResolver.java, resolve.
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/web/RuntimeSessionController.java, create.
' Source evidence (pi-mono-java 304eda06ff603fc9b6bbcaad0c296cc151a7defb):
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/web/RuntimeSessionController.java, create.
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/vo/CreateSessionResponseVO.java.
' Observed behavior: the current Java wire path and response still use agent_id and session_id.
' Observed behavior: settings chooses a default model candidate and the model manager validates it.
' Observed behavior: current Java accepts agent_ plus 24 alphanumeric characters and persists thinking false.
' Observed behavior: RandomSessionIdGenerator.nextId returns 26 Crockford Base32 characters with no prefix.
' Architecture change: target Agent and Session IDs use a type prefix plus 32 hex UUID characters.
' Architecture change: target HTTP path and payload fields use lowerCamelCase while header names stay unchanged.
' Product constraint: successful target creation persists thinking true.
' Product constraint: all Runtime operations carry integration-context headers without local validation.
' Observed behavior: creation persists an idle Session and does not initialize AgentSession or invoke a model.
' Architecture change: the materialized Session starts with zero lifetime Usage.
' Design reason: defer expensive runtime initialization until the first accepted user event.

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #475569
  FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

actor "mate-service\nRuntime bridge" as Mate
participant "Runtime HTTP API" as API
participant "AgentDirectoryResolver" as Resolver
participant "Model Manager" as Models
participant "SessionIdGenerator" as Ids
database "RuntimeSessionStore" as Store
participant "ResultBeanAdapter" as ResultAdapter

Mate -> API : POST /agents/{agentId}/sessions\ncontext headers and no request body
API -> API : do not validate integration credentials
API -> API : validate agent- plus 32 hex UUID characters
API -> Resolver : resolve(agentId)
Resolver -> Resolver : verify controlled root and symlink boundary\nload settings.json
Resolver --> API : agent directory, defaultModel, enabledModels
API -> Models : resolveDefaultModel(snapshot)
Models --> API : authoritative ModelDescriptor
API -> Ids : generate globally unique sessionId
Ids --> API : session- plus 32 hex UUID characters
API -> Store : insert SessionRecord\nstate idle, thinking true, version 1, zero lifetimeUsage
Store --> API : committed
API -> ResultAdapter : normal(CreateSessionResponseVO)
ResultAdapter --> API : resCode, resMsg, result
API --> Mate : 201 Created plus Location\nResultBean with SessionResource in result

note over API,Store
Before commit, a failure does not expose sessionId.
After commit, state is idle and no MessageEntry or AgentSession exists.
The persisted deep-thinking switch is true.
AgentSession is initialized lazily by the first user event.
The response contains only Session identity, current defaults,
coarse state, and creation time.
end note

note over API,Ids
The target sessionId has the session- prefix
and a 32-character hexadecimal UUID payload.
UUID hyphens and legacy unprefixed IDs are rejected.
end note

note over Mate,API
This operation has no Idempotency-Key or If-Match.
Every successful POST creates a new Session.
A lost successful response can produce an orphan Session,
which background timeout cleanup must remove if unbound.
end note

note over API,Store
The database agent_id value has 38 characters.
Widen the current VARCHAR(30) column to VARCHAR(64)
before enabling the new identifier contract.
end note
@enduml

